      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could take a non-shading parameter here to also handle resetting the required alignment and remove `alignForNonShading()`?\n\nPipelineDataGatherer can call this markRewindOffset() and then query the uniform manager\u0027s size afterwards?\n\nWe also need non-shading uniforms to start at their required alignment, not the required alignment of the paint uniform block. So we could have the branching behavior determined by whether or not we pass in a required alignment to start at. RenderSteps would calculate their required alignment at creation time so that DrawList could pass it in if they don\u0027t perform shading.",
